# Paths excluded from `git archive` (used by scripts/build_release.sh to
# produce the artifact that actually gets deployed to a student-facing
# target). These files narrate or explain the lab's own vulnerabilities in
# plain English and must never travel to a box a student can reach, whether
# over SSH, via a stray file-serving misconfiguration, or by reading the
# repo on GitHub. Full history (commit messages included) is already
# excluded by `git archive` automatically -- it never carries logs/refs.
docs/** export-ignore
SECURITY.md export-ignore
vulnerable/upload/README.md export-ignore
vulnerable/privilege_escalation/README.md export-ignore
README.md export-ignore
README.release.md export-ignore
